    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1replication_1_1_field_level_merge_resolver" kindref="compound">FieldLevelMergeResolver</ref></para>
<para>Merges individual JSON top-level fields according to a configurable strategy.</para>
<para>Strategies: UNION — Include all fields; on conflict prefer the write with the latest HLC timestamp for that specific field. INTERSECT — Only include fields present in ALL conflicting writes; on conflict prefer the latest HLC timestamp. LEFT_BIAS — For conflicting fields always prefer the first entry in conflicting_writes (i.e., the one with the lowest HLC). RIGHT_BIAS — For conflicting fields always prefer the last entry in conflicting_writes (i.e., the one with the highest HLC). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
